# Flight Reservation System

## Setup Instructions

### 1. Create database
CREATE DATABASE project_db;
USE project_db;

### 2. Import schema
source sql/schema.sql;

### 3. Run Java
javac src/*.java
java src.Main

## Features
- Search flights (direct & with stops)
- Book tickets
- Waitlist system
- Cancel reservations

## Database Tables
- Airlines
- Aircraft
- Airports
- Flights
- Tickets
- Includes
- Waiting_List
- Customers
- Employees

## Notes
- Uses MySQL
- Uses JDBC in Java
